android: A6 — sol2: noexcept(trait) on member templates breaks NDK clang

NDK r27 clang+libc++ reject member function templates whose noexcept-spec
uses std::is_nothrow_copy_assignable_v<T> of the enclosing class template
("substitution failure" when taking the address as lua_CFunction); libstdc++
and hoisting the trait into a constexpr member both work. Minimal fix:
plain noexcept at the three affected sol::function_detail call sites.
Semantically moot for our -fno-exceptions build.

---
diff --git a/thirdparty/sol/sol.hpp b/thirdparty/sol/sol.hpp
index bbf8942..aed7b7a 100644
